{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"layout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLLayoutV","text":"MXLLayout","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":" = MXLLayout(), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"measureLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLMeasureLayoutV","text":"MXLMeasureLayout","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMeasureLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"measureNumbering"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL19MXLMeasureNumberingV","text":"MXLMeasureNumbering","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLMeasureNumbering"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"partNameDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNameDisplayV","text":"MXLNameDisplay","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNameDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"partAbbreviationDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNameDisplayV","text":"MXLNameDisplay","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNameDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"attributes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLPrintV10AttributesV","text":"Attributes","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrint\/Attributes-swift.struct"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"id","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that specifies an id reference."}]}]},{"name":"layout","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The layout group specifies the sequence of page, system, and staff layout elements that is common to both the defaults and print elements."}]}]},{"name":"measureLayout","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the horizontal distance from the previous measure, in tenths."}]}]},{"name":"measureNumbering","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies details about measure numbering displayed at this point in the score."}]}]},{"name":"partNameDisplay","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes how the part name is displayed, taking effect when the current measure or a succeeding measure starts a new system."}]}]},{"name":"partAbbreviationDisplay","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes how the part abbreviation is displayed, taking effect when the current measure or a succeeding measure starts a new system."}]}]},{"name":"attributes","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The print-attributes group is used by the print element. The new-system and new-page attributes indicate whether to force a system or page break, or to force the current music onto the same system or page as the preceding music. Normally this is the first music data within a measure. If used in multi-part music, they should be placed in the same positions within each part, or the results are undefined. The page-number attribute sets the number of a new page; it is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. Version 2.0 adds a blank-page attribute. This is a positive integer value that specifies the number of blank pages to insert before the current measure. It is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. These blank pages have no music, but may have text or images specified by the credit element. This is used to allow a combination of pages that are all text, or all text and images, together with pages of music."}]}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrint\/init(id:layout:measureLayout:measureNumbering:partNameDisplay:partAbbreviationDisplay:attributes:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPrint"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Initializer","symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"layout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLLayoutV","text":"MXLLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"measureLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL16MXLMeasureLayoutV","text":"MXLMeasureLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"measureNumbering"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL19MXLMeasureNumberingV","text":"MXLMeasureNumbering"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"partNameDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNameDisplayV","text":"MXLNameDisplay"},{"kind":"text"